Scale generator day ranges for short worlds; record stage 0 decisions

rday() keeps 12-month worlds byte-identical and makes 3-month smoke worlds
valid. decisions.md gains a plan-clause column and the stage 0 decisions
(own generator, template renderer, coordination-window rule, MiMo download
and serving, vLLM image, shared pre-intervention snapshot, maintenance
schedule, paired probes for gold-invariant shifts).

